---
const xp = Math.abs(new Date().getFullYear() - 2020);
---

<div>
  <h1>Hi, I'm <span>Diego</span></h1>
  <p class="subtitle">Fullstack developer</p>
  <p>
    Fullstack developer with {xp} years of experience building web applications. Background in Biological Sciences (BSc) and Ecology (MSc), bringing a scientific approach to analyzing and breaking down complex systems.
  </p>
  <p>
    When I'm not at a keyboard, I'm probably with a cat, deep into a game, out somewhere in nature, or working through a reading list that keeps growing faster than I can finish it.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 5.5rem);
  }

  .subtitle {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }
</style>
